  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Mix components and adjust pH to 7.0. Dispense the solution into culture vessels (e.g., 10 ml in the Hungate tubes) under a N2--CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas stream, seal with butyl rubber stoppers and autoclave."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "To complete the medium, anaerobically and aseptically add the following solutions (autoclaved under a N2 atmosphere) to the medium (per 10 ml):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "Comment: Sodium nitrate can be substituted by ferric citrate (20 mM)."
    }
  ]
}